What this fork changes
----------------------
- The npm package name and the browser module-loader id are `dsh-pet-slim`, so
  the package does not collide with the upstream `dsh-pet` name on the registry.
- repository / homepage / bugs metadata point at the fork repository.
- Behavioural changes on top of the upstream release are tracked in the fork
  repository's history; this package does not claim to be the upstream build.

The internal asset route prefix (`/dsh-pet-7340`) is kept unchanged, so existing
upstream documentation and asset URLs stay valid.
